{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t海關本月開展專項調查行動，打擊非法進口動物活動，並偵破兩宗懷疑非法進口動物的案件，檢獲7隻活貓及2隻活犬，估計市值共約9萬2千元，7人被捕。<br/>\n<br/>\n海關聯同漁護署下午舉行聯合簡報會，講述案件詳情。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T05:03:54.515910+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T04:36:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T08:57:35.173371+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T04:57:26.522185+00:00","content_hash":"7c8fee124b784438fba252c80a7d84d8ba1837286b4c7ac84c1569bc3de6a4cd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}